    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 608,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "BT Mobile\nBT Mobile is a mobile virtual network operator ( MVNO ) provided by BT Consumer ; a division of BT Group in the United Kingdom that was launched in March 2015 . It uses the EE network via an MVNO agreement signed in March 2014 as well as using the spectrum BT won in the 2013 's 4G auction . EE is now owned by BT Group following a successful acquisition that was officially completed on 29 January 2016 . BT Mobile operates alongside BT Business Mobile which is provided by the BT Business division . BT Mobile is currently a SIM-only service and has more than 400,000 customers as of 5 May 2016 ."
     }
